"Repair or replacement – your choice

Hi Erika Beispiel,

thank you for your message about your order PC-2026-00017. I am sorry that something is wrong with your piece.

Order number: PC-2026-00017
Complaint received on: 16 Oct 2026
Type: damaged in transit

Affected:

- No. 017 · Tasse „Coco schläft“

You can choose whether I should repair the piece or whether you would like a replacement. I will cover the costs, including shipping.

Since every one of my pieces is one of a kind, an identical replacement is usually not possible. If a replacement is not possible, we will talk about the other options together.

If you choose the repair, your statutory liability period for defects for the piece is extended by 12 months.

Your statutory rights remain unaffected.

Just reply to this email and let me know what you prefer.

